    "summary": "Close M2-W02-C01 by falsifying absent provider-independent discovery, delivering immutable public capability enumeration without provider or permission binding, and verifying no-result, provenance and public-assembly boundaries with eight GREEN tests, prior T1 and IR regressions and local NuGet packaging.",
    "value": "Consumers can enumerate stable inspectable composition descriptions and distinguish unrecognized operations or incomplete results without assuming installed providers, AURA permissions, or mathematical execution.",
