      "No mathematical solver, numerical provider, pipeline scheduler, AURA host linkage, external package publishing, or consumer adoption is introduced."
    ],
    "nextAction": "Proceed with a substantial M2-W02-C02-T1 contract and independent RED/GREEN for typed direct and fluent pipelines with unit dimension validation, without claiming execution across unavailable providers.",
    "achievements": [
